ct\n  constexpr).\n- Backport the GStreamerCommon.h <WebCore/GraphicsTypesGL.h> include from\n  upstream 2.54.1; GCC resolves the symlinked WebCore private headers to\n  their real path, so the quoted include is not found when building the PCH.\n- Drop the vendored Skia backports for CVE-2026-5870, CVE-2026-7920,\n  CVE-2026-7923, CVE-2026-10009 and CVE-2026-11663 (was Patch20..Patch24);\n  the Skia snapshot bundled with 2.54.0 already includes them.\n- CVEs resolved by this rebase (62 total):\n  CVE-2026-3538, CVE-2026-3909, CVE-2026-4460, CVE-2026-6298, CVE-2026-6364,\n  CVE-2026-7353, CVE-2026-7949, CVE-2026-8510, CVE-2026-8579, CVE-2026-9983,\n  CVE-2026-9998, CVE-2026-10011, CVE-2026-10977, CVE-2026-10985,\n  CVE-2026-11024, CVE-2026-11039, CVE-2026-11057, CVE-2026-11099,\n  CVE-2026-11121, CVE-2026-11124, CVE-2026-11159, CVE-2026-11675,\n  CVE-2026-13971, CVE-2026-14389, CVE-2026-14414, CVE-2026-14427,\n  CVE-2026-15766, CVE-2026-16417, CVE-2026-17702, CVE-2026-17745,\n  CVE-2026-17757, CVE-2026-17914, CVE-2026-19160, CVE-2026-19161,\n  CVE-2026-19176, CVE-2026-43804, CVE-2026-64713, CVE-2026-64728,\n  CVE-2026-64730, CVE-2026-64753, CVE-2026-64757, CVE-2026-64778,\n  CVE-2026-64779, CVE-2026-64782, CVE-2026-64783, CVE-2026-64784,\n  CVE-2026-65332, CVE-2026-65336, CVE-2026-65337, CVE-2026-65341,\n  CVE-2026-65351, CVE-2026-76041, CVE-2026-78376, CVE-2026-78914,\n  CVE-2026-79020, CVE-2026-79112, CVE-2026-79144, CVE-2026-79147,\n  CVE-2026-83596, CVE-2026-84359, CVE-2026-84635, CVE-2026-85049","affected":[{"package":{"name":"webkit2gtk3","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.2","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/webkit2gtk3?distro=almalinux-9.2"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.54.0-1.el9.tuxcare.els12"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/almalinux9.2esu/CLSA-2026-1791973636.json"}},{"package":{"name":"webkit2gtk3-devel","ecosystem":"TuxCare:AlmaLinux:9.2","purl":"pkg:rpm/tux